*substr* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''substr(string, start, length)''

Extracts a substring from a string starting at a specified position.

*Parameters:*
- ''string'': String to extract from
- ''start'': Number starting position (1-based)
- ''length'': Number of characters to extract

*Returns:*
- String: Substring of specified length starting at start position

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if string is not a string
- Runtime error if start is not a number
- Runtime error if length is not a number
- Runtime error if start is less than 1 or length is negative
